  This operator acts on [batch] matrix with compatible shape.
  `x` is a batch matrix with compatible shape for `matmul` and `solve` if

  ```
  operator.shape = [B1,...,Bb] + [N, N],  with b >= 0
  x.shape =        [B1,...,Bb] + [N, R],  with R >= 0.
